VER                                                      [2.20, 3.0]
---

Format:      VER

Purpose:     Displays the system's version numbers.

Use:         The version numbers of the three main components of the
        Nextor disk system are displayed:  the Nextor kernel (in the
        ROM of the machine or of a cartridge),  NEXTOR.SYS  and  the
        command interpreter itself.

Examples:

        VER
        Nextor kernel version 3.0.0
        NEXTOR.SYS version 3.00
        Nextor command interpreter 3.0

        TYPE COMMAND3.COM for more details

             The version numbers of all the components of the Nextor
        disk system are printed out.
